          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kama sadaka hiyo ya kufanya amani unayomtolea Mwenyezi-Mungu ni kutoka kundi la kondoo au mbuzi, basi achaguliwe dume au jike asiye na dosari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kama mtu atatoa mwanakondoo kuwa sadaka yake, basi, atamtolea mbele ya Mwenyezi-Mungu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akiweka mkono wake juu ya kichwa cha mnyama huyo na kumchinja mbele ya hema la mkutano. Makuhani wazawa wa Aroni watainyunyizia madhabahu damu yake pande zake zote. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kisha, kutoka katika sadaka hiyo ya amani anayotolewa Mwenyezi-Mungu kwa moto, atamtolea sehemu zifuatazo: Mafuta yake, mkia wenye mafuta mzima uliokatwa karibu kabisa na uti wa mgongo pamoja na mafuta yote yanayofunika matumbo na mafuta yote yaliyo kwenye matumbo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "zile figo mbili na mafuta yake pamoja na sehemu bora ya ini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 3:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuhani ataviteketeza hivyo vyote juu ya madhabahu kama chakula anachotolewa Mwenyezi-Mungu kwa moto.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.3.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.3.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
